<div class="editor-main">
    {{#if formError}}<div class="notice notice-error" role="alert">{{formError}}{{> _error_reference}}</div>{{/if}}
    <div class="field-group"><label for="title">Story title <span class="required-note">(required)</span></label><input type="text" id="title" name="title" value="{{story.title}}" placeholder="Give your story a title" required aria-describedby="title-error"><p class="field-error" id="title-error" hidden>Please give your story a title.</p></div>
    <div class="field-group"><div class="field-label-row"><label for="body">Your story <span class="required-note">(required)</span></label><span class="word-count" data-word-count></span></div><textarea name="body" id="body" rows="14" placeholder="It began with…" required aria-describedby="body-help body-error">{{story.body}}</textarea><p id="body-help" class="field-hint">There’s no perfect place to start. Just make it your own.</p><p class="field-error" id="body-error" hidden>Add a few words before saving your story.</p></div>
    <p class="field-error" data-form-error role="alert" hidden></p>
    <div class="editor-actions"><button type="submit" class="button button-primary" data-save-button><i class="fa-solid fa-check" aria-hidden="true"></i> {{#if editing}}Save changes{{else}}Save story{{/if}}</button><a href="/dashboard" class="button button-secondary">Cancel</a><span class="save-note">Your words are saved when you choose Save.</span></div>
</div>
<aside class="editor-sidebar"><div class="settings-card"><span class="eyebrow">Your story, your choice</span><h2>Who can read it?</h2><label for="status">Story visibility</label><select name="status" id="status" aria-describedby="visibility-help"><option value="public" {{#unless (eq story.status 'private')}}selected{{/unless}}>Public — share with the community</option><option value="private" {{#if (eq story.status 'private')}}selected{{/if}}>Private — only you</option></select><p id="visibility-help" class="field-hint" data-visibility-help>{{#if (eq story.status 'private')}}Only you can read this story.{{else}}Anyone signed in can discover and read this story.{{/if}}</p><div class="sidebar-divider"></div><i class="fa-regular fa-lightbulb writing-tip-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i><h3>A small writing nudge</h3><p>Think of a moment you’d like to return to. What did you notice? How did it feel?</p><p class="quiet-note">You can change visibility whenever you like.</p></div></aside>
